{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 18, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The bustling stalls and sushi restaurants were a sensory overload, with the freshest seafood I've ever tasted. I was also impressed by the serene gardens and temples that dotted the city, such as the beautiful Meiji Shrine.\n\nAs I traveled throughout the country, I was amazed by the efficiency and punctuality of Japan's transportation system. The bullet trains whisked me away to cities like Kyoto and Osaka, where I explored historic landmarks like the Kiyomizu-dera temple and Osaka Castle.\n\nBut it was the little things that really made my trip special - the polite smiles and bows from the locals, the delicious street food, and the quirky vending machines that seemed to be around every corner. Japan has a way of making you feel like you're experiencing something truly unique and special, and I'm already planning my next trip back.\n\nOverall, Japan was a country that exceeded my expectations in every way. From its vibrant cities to its tranquil countryside, there's something for everyone in this fascinating and beautiful country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0041772969998419285}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20400966703891754}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5827606320381165}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.00044490929576568305}, {"token": " experience", "l